<back><div type="verses">
<lg label="2."><l>Who else but Thee, O Father,</l><l>Could in Thine only Son</l><l>So bless us with Thy Spirit,</l><l>And have us for Thine own?</l><l>Soon shall we be forever</l><l>With Christ in glory; then</l><l>We’ll shine in His blest image</l><l>Eternally, Amen!</l></lg>
</div>
</back>
</music></mei>
